# The Vercel project's root directory is web/, but the CLI still uploads the
# whole repo as build context — which is 29k files once every node_modules is
# counted, over Vercel's 15k limit. Nothing outside web/ is ever built.
#
# Only matters for manual `vercel deploy` from the repo root; the Git
# integration clones the repo and ignores this file.

